<title>JAPAN: Credia to issue 3 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Credia to issue 3 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Credia Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Mitsubishi Trust Bank</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   1	  AMT   3 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Mar.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 2.Dec.96   CONV TO 30.Mar.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 8.Nov.96   INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 24.Oct-31.Oct</p>
<p> LAST JCR   BBB-	LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on October 23.</p>
</text>
